  "run_label": "sage_semantic_all_v1_chunk_monodepth2_photometric_loss_components",
  "answer": "<think>The question asks about the components of Monodepth2's photometric reconstruction loss function. Let me examine the provided materials.\n\nLooking through all the data sources, I see references to various components mentioned in the ablation tables:\n- \"w/o pt\" - removing photometric loss\n- \"w/o auto-masking\"\n- \"w/o min reproj\" - minimum reprojection loss\n- \"w/o full-res m.s.\" - full-resolution multi-scale\n- \"w/o SSIM\"\n- \"with [76]'s mask\"\n\nThese suggest the photometric reconstruction loss in Monodepth2 consists of components like:\n1. Photometric loss (pt)\n2. SSIM (Structural Similarity)\n3. Auto-masking\n4. Minimum reprojection loss\n5. Full-resolution multi-scale\n\nHowever, the provided materials are just ablation table fragments and don't actually describe the loss function components in detail. The materials don't explicitly list or describe what makes up the photometric reconstruction loss.\n\nI should answer based on what can be inferred from the ablation study references in the materials, while noting that the detailed descriptions are not fully provided in the given materials.\n\nBased on the ablation entries:\n- \"w/o pt\" suggests there's a photometric loss component\n- \"w/o SSIM\" suggests SSIM is part of the loss\n- \"w/o auto-masking\" suggests auto-masking\n- \"w/o min reproj\" suggests minimum reprojection\n- \"w/o full-res m.s.\" suggests full-resolution multi-scale\n\nThese are the components that can be inferred from the ablation studies. But the actual detailed description of each component is not provided in the materials.\n\nLet me construct the answer based on what's visible in the tables.</think>\n\n{\n  \"answer\": \"根据资料中的消融实验表格，Monodepth2的光度重建损失函数涉及以下组件，但资料未提供各组件的详细数学定义。\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"光度重建损失（photometric loss）\",\n      \"description\": \"基础光度重建项，对应消融项 'w/o pt'（去除光度损失），资料[3][4][10]中可见相关对比\",\n      \"citations\": [3, 4, 10]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"SSIM\",\n      \"description\": \"结构相似性损失组件，对应消融项 'w/o SSIM'，资料[7][8]中可见 'Monodepth2 w/o SSIM' 的对比行\",\n      \"citations\": [7, 8]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Auto-masking（自动掩码）\",\n      \"description\": \"用于过滤违反相机运动假设的像素，对应消融项 'w/o pt or auto-masking'，资料[10]中可见相关对比行\",\n      \"citations\": [10]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Minimum reprojection（最小重投影损失）\",\n      \"description\": \"在多尺度/多帧间取最小重投影误差，对应消融项 'w/o pt or min reproj'，资料[10]中可见相关对比行\",\n      \"citations\": [10]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Full-resolution multi-scale（全分辨率多尺度）\",\n      \"description\": \"全分辨率多尺度采样策略，对应消融项 'w/o full-res m.s.'，资料[1][2][7][8]中可见相关对比行\",\n      \"citations\": [1, 2, 7, 8]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"missing_information\": \"资料仅为表格碎片，未包含光度重建损失各组件的数学定义与详细说明；具体公式（如 L1 项、SSIM 项如何组合、加权系数等）缺失。\"\n}",
